    "Do not modify original node values or links.",
    "-2,000,000,000,000 ≤ target ≤ 2,000,000,000,000.",
    "A route follows child links only; start and end are any original nodes."
  ],
  "interface": "Solution.solve(root,target) receives TreeNode and long / long long and returns int.",
